Revolution R Enterprise 6.1 includes two important advances in high
performance predictive analytics with R:  (1) big data decision trees, and
(2) the ability to easily extract and perform predictive analytics on data
stored in the Hadoop Distributed File System (HDFS).

Classification and regression trees are among the most frequently used
algorithms for data analysis and data mining. The implementation provided
in Revolution Analytics’ RevoScaleR package is parallelized, scalable,
