statisticians today: because it's the most powerful statistical language in
the world. Revolution Analytics builds on the power of open source R, and
adds performance, productivity and integration features to create
Revolution R Enterprise. In this webinar, author and blogger David Smith
will introduce the additional capabilities of Revolution R Enterprise.
 *Presented
